                  "  1. the device is connected with a USB data cable (not a charge-only one);\n"
                  "  2. \"USB tethering\" is enabled on the device;\n"
                  "  3. the phone is unlocked and trusts this Mac (some devices hide the RNDIS "
                  "interface while locked).\n"
                  "  Run `system_profiler SPUSBDataType` to confirm the system sees the device.")
